00:56:50.190 --> 00:56:52.850
<v Francis Lai-Fang>What we have on this truck is going to be pumps.
<v Francis Lai-Fang>这辆卡车上装的是泵。

00:56:52.850 --> 00:56:57.480
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

